02.05 T"ZELLER'S CONGRUENCE IS APPLIED TO CALCULATE THE DAY OF
02.07 T"THE WEEK"!"FOLLOWING INPUT OF MONTH(2 DIGITS),DAY(2 DIGITS)
02.09 T", AND YEAR(4 DIGITS)"!"INPUT IS SELF TERMINATING"!!
02.11 T"GREGORIAN CALENDAR EXCLUDES DATES PRIOR TO 1500"!!;C 1582
02.20 T!"GIVE MONTH, DAY, AND YEAR"!;O C;O X
02.25 A Z(1),Z(2),"  "Z(3),Z(4),"  "Z(5),Z(6),Z(7),Z(8);O I
02.26 F I=1,8;S Z(I)=Z(I)-176
02.30 S K=Z(3)*10+Z(4);S C=Z(5)*10+Z(6);I(C-15)2.11;S D=Z(7)*10+Z(8)
02.35 S M=10*Z(1)+Z(2);I(M-2)2.4,2.4;S M=M-2;G 2.45
02.40 S M=M+10;S D=D-1
02.45 T"  THE DAY IS :  "
02.50 S R=[FITR(<2.6*M>-.199)]+[K]+[D]+[FITR(D/4)]+[FITR(C/4)]-(2*C)
02.55 I(R-7)2.6;S R=R-7;G 2.55
02.60 D +3+(.1*R)+.1;G 2.2

03.10 T"SUNDAY
03.20 T"MONDAY
03.30 T"TUESDAY
